      "explanation": "The inclusion of OCR (pytesseract) functionality without explicit declaration in the manifest violates the principle of least privilege. This capability could be used to extract sensitive data from images or documents that the user expects to be private, and OCR processes often involve additional external dependencies that may have their own vulnerabilities.",
